    "help": {
      "title": "Help & Guide",
      "message": " Lumberjack - Help",
      "overviewBlock": "━━━━━━━━━━━━ OVERVIEW ━━━━━━━━━━━━\nLumberjack is a log viewer for large datasets\nand live sources with a focus on performance.",
      "dataSourcesBlock": "━━━━━━━━━━━ DATA SOURCES ━━━━━━━━━━━\n Files: .log, .json, .jsonl, .txt and .zip\n   → Open via menu or Drag & Drop\n\n HTTP: One-time loading or periodic polling\n   → Automatic deduplication during polling\n\n TCP: Live log server for real-time streams\n   → Port configurable in settings\n\n Elasticsearch: Fetch logs from ES clusters\n   → With time filter and field search",
      "searchBlock": "━━━━━━━━━━ FULL-TEXT SEARCH ━━━━━━━━━━\nSyntax for message search:\n\n  PHRASE: \"hello world\" → exact string (with spaces)\n  AND:   foo bar       → contains 'foo' AND 'bar' (implicit)\n  AND:   foo&bar       → contains 'foo' AND 'bar' (explicit)\n  OR:    foo|bar       → contains 'foo' OR 'bar'\n  NOT:   !foo          → does NOT contain 'foo'\n  Combined: foo&!bar   → 'foo' but NOT 'bar'\n  Grouping: xml&(CB|AGV) → 'xml' and ('CB' or 'AGV')\n  Escape: Tom\\&Jerry   → searches literally for 'Tom&Jerry'\n\nOptions (⚙️ button next to search field):\n  • Case-insensitive (default)\n  • Case-sensitive\n  • Regex mode",
      "filterBlock": "━━━━━━━━━━━━ FILTERS ━━━━━━━━━━━━\n️ Filter button: Expandable filter bar\n   • Level: TRACE, DEBUG, INFO, WARN, ERROR, FATAL\n   • Logger: Substring search in logger name\n   • Thread: Filter by thread name\n   • Message: Full-text search (see above)\n   • Marked only: Show only marked entries\n   • Filter profiles: Save & reuse filters\n\n️ DC Filter: Mapped Diagnostic Context (MDC)\n   • TraceID, SpanID and custom keys\n   • Quick-add for common keys",
      "keyboardBlock": "━━━━━━━━ KEYBOARD SHORTCUTS ━━━━━━━━\n⌘/Ctrl + F     Focus search field\n⌘/Ctrl + ⇧ + F Toggle filters\n⌘/Ctrl + K     Open Command Palette\nF1             Open help\nEnter          Next match (in search field)\nj / k          Navigation (Vim-style)\ng / G          Go to start/end\nn / N          Next/Previous match\n↑ / ↓          Navigation (standard)\n⇧ + ↑/↓/j/k   Multi-select (range)\nHome / End     Go to start/end\nEscape         Clear selection",
      "tipsBlock": "━━━━━━━━━ MORE TIPS ━━━━━━━━━\n• Command Palette (⌘/Ctrl+K) for quick access\n• Right-click on rows for context menu\n• Markings with colors for important entries\n• Follow mode: Auto-scroll to new entries\n• Trace Timeline: Trace visualization in detail panel\n• Search history: Arrow ↓ in search field\n• Export: Visible logs as JSON/CSV (⌘/Ctrl+S)\n• Detail panel height adjustable by dragging\n• Column widths adjustable by dragging"
    }
  },
